The Glacite adaptation and Lumenstone Columns content are maintained by KyleMHB. Glacite changes include cooling instead of heating, frost damage, new identifiers and blue replacement sprites. See CREDITS.md for attribution, ARTWORK.md for the Glacite generation record, and COLUMN-ART-PROMPTS.txt for column artwork provenance.

RimWorld assets referenced at runtime remain the property of Ludeon Studios. The Pyrinth pylon menu icon is a centered export of DetVisor's artwork under the same CC BY 4.0 license. Remaining optional Pyrinth content is supplied by the installed Pyrinth mod.

This notice preserves the inherited Glacite license. The linked CC BY 4.0 legal code contains the complete terms.
